    "Artifact and source digests were checked against the six successful required jobs of run 41149659054. GitHub API reads used the Windows network exit after the Linux exit reached its anonymous rate limit; TLS verification remained enabled.",
    "Compressed web asset responses match CI byte-for-byte. An uncompressed HTML probe additionally contained the existing Cloudflare analytics injection; it was not treated as a changed build asset."
